    "content": "<p>操作路径：点击左侧栏客户-报价管理-导入改价</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/81b0e69299270b595ee37ba9333fd7bb.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>然后点击下载表格。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/e09b2e8208b5bd1ac8b9be22258c649b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/24f354aa23b11f922039c8346b91f232.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>打开表格，修改最新报价保存，然后再导入到软件里。</p>\n<p>注意：只能修改导出的这些报价再导入回去，不能新增报价。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202501/6a1a4fbdfb395aedfa81669111983672.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
